- technically, to swap between one range and another you could switch comparators quite easily, but this doesn't help if you want the activation range to be more dynamic.\
- What\'92s really needed is a method for comparing 2 analogue signals, which is again pretty simple to do. To create a system where input 1 must be greater than input 2 to activate:\
